{
  "root_node": "source.raw.orders",
  "cause": "upstream_data",
  "action": "escalate",
  "evidence": "The freshness check assert_orders_fresh fails on stg_orders, which simply selects from raw.orders without transformation. Raw.orders has 14,941 rows with _loaded_at ranging from 1992-01-02 to 1998-07-26, and no rows newer than 1998. The staging view stg_orders mirrors these timestamps (max order_date 1998-07-25). Since the freshness test expects recent data (e.g., within the last day) and finds 1 stale row, the problem originates at the source raw.orders where ingestion has stopped. No code change can generate newer timestamps, so the issue must be escalated to the source owner."
}
